OL,3,GNEWSA'Handsome' ponies helping delicate
OL,4,Aflowers thrive
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo fell ponies have joined a herd to
OL,7,Ftrample dominant vegetation to try and
OL,8,Fhelp delicate flowers thrive.
OL,10,FAnnabel Rushton, site manager of RSPB
OL,11,FWild Haweswater, said the native
OL,12,FCumbrian fell breed were "ideally
OL,13,Fsuited" to the rugged terrain and
OL,14,Fweather in Swindale Valley, where they
OL,15,Fwould graze and crush rushes and coarse
OL,16,Fgrasses.
OL,18,FWild Haweswater said the grazing
OL,19,Fproject would aid delicate wildflowers
OL,20,Flike Devil's Bit Scabious and the
OL,21,Fponies were good at spreading
OL,22,Fwildflower seed in their dung.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
