OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Handsome' ponies helping delicate
OL,4,Aflowers thrive
OL,5,
OL,6,FRushton said the two "handsome boys"
OL,7,FWilliam and Jasper, would join four
OL,8,Fmares to live outside, drink from
OL,9,Fstreams and springs and shelter behind
OL,10,Fdry stone walls and under trees.
